## Goal
How do the six samples (A1-A3 untreated, B1-B3 treated) cluster? Run a PCA on the gene-level
counts and plot the samples in PC1/PC2 space, coloured by condition.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

